Title:		BoboBot
Version:	Alpha 3 (Preview Release 2)
Entered-date:	1999-March-16
Description:	BoboBot is a one-player game that falls into the "platform," or
		"run-and-jump" genre. Travel to eight levels to.  After you've
		fought your way past screenfuls of enemies and obstacles, you
		must beat the "boss" of the level.  Upon doing so, you gain
		a new weapon.
Keywords:	X11,game,megaman,platform,arcade,capcom
Author:		bobobot@newbreedsoftware.com (Bill Kendrick)
Maintained-by:	bobobot@newbreedsoftware.com (Bill Kendrick)
Primary-site:	ftp.sonic.net pub/users/nbs/unix/x/bobobot/
		1516Kb bobobot-preview2.tar.gz
Copying-policy:	Freeware
